  "notes": "{昇進|しょうしん} means being promoted to a higher position or rank at work. As a suru-verb, it means \"to be promoted\", \"to advance in rank\".\n\nRelated terms:\n- {昇給|しょうきゅう} (salary increase)\n- {降格|こうかく} (demotion) - antonym\n- {出世|しゅっせ} (career advancement, getting ahead)\n\nCommon expressions:\n- 〜に{昇進|しょうしん}する (be promoted to ~)\n- {昇進|しょうしん}を{目指|めざ}す (aim for promotion)\n- {昇進|しょうしん}{試験|しけん} (promotion exam)",
